---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import SiteHeader from '../components/SiteHeader.astro';
import SiteFooter from '../components/SiteFooter.astro';
import AssuranceMark from '../components/AssuranceMark.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Privacy Policy — Assurer">

  <!-- Navigation (R1: inherits DEFAULT_LINKS) -->
  <SiteHeader />

  <main id="main" tabindex="-1" class="flex flex-1 flex-col focus:outline-none">
    <section data-reveal class="container-content py-16 sm:py-24">
      <!-- §3.7G anchor: the same quiet trust mark, small and top-left of the
           column (≥640 only; document pages keep a text-first hero) -->
      <div class="mb-6 hidden sm:block">
        <AssuranceMark class="h-[72px] w-[72px]" />
      </div>
      <p class="font-mono uppercase tracking-wider text-brand-accent">Legal</p>
      <h1 class="mt-4 max-w-3xl text-balance leading-tight text-[clamp(1.75rem,7.5vw,3rem)]">Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p class="mt-4 text-sm text-secondary">Last updated: August 2026</p>

      <div class="mx-auto mt-8 max-w-3xl space-y-8 text-body">
        <section>
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-ink">What We Collect<span class="heading-underline" aria-hidden="true"></span></h2>
          <p class="mt-2">This website has no forms and collects no personal data directly. We do not use tracking cookies, analytics pixels, or fingerprinting. Fonts are loaded from Google Fonts, which sees the standard web-server request metadata (including your IP address) when a page renders.</p>
          <p class="mt-2">If you choose to contact us — via GitHub issues on <a href="https://github.com/mabel-co" class="text-brand-accent hover:underline">our GitHub organisation</a> — we hold only what you choose to send us.</p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-ink">Where Your Data Is Stored<span class="heading-underline" aria-hidden="true"></span></h2>
          <p class="mt-2">We do not store personal data on any website server or third-party mailing-list platform. Correspondence you send us through GitHub is stored by GitHub under its own terms; correspondence sent to our team email is subject to our standard email retention policy.</p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-ink">Why We Process Your Data<span class="heading-underline" aria-hidden="true"></span></h2>
          <p class="mt-2">We process the limited data above on the basis of legitimate interest in operating a website and responding to inbound interest. If you contact us, we use your details only to:</p>
          <ul class="mt-2 space-y-3">
            <li class="flex items-start gap-3"><svg class="mt-1 h-4 w-4 flex-shrink-0 text-brand-accent" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"/></svg><span>Reply to your questions and interest in early access.</span></li>
          </ul>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-ink">How Long We Keep Your Data<span class="heading-underline" aria-hidden="true"></span></h2>
          <p class="mt-2">We keep correspondence only as long as needed to answer it, and you can request deletion at any time. We do not run a marketing mailing list, so there is nothing to subscribe to or unsubscribe from.</p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-ink">Your Rights<span class="heading-underline" aria-hidden="true"></span></h2>
          <p class="mt-2">Under GDPR, you have the right to:</p>
          <ul class="mt-2 space-y-3">
            <li class="flex items-start gap-3"><svg class="mt-1 h-4 w-4 flex-shrink-0 text-brand-accent" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"/></svg><span><strong>Access</strong> — request a copy of the personal data we hold about you.</span></li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-3"><svg class="mt-1 h-4 w-4 flex-shrink-0 text-brand-accent" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"/></svg><span><strong>Rectification</strong> — request correction of inaccurate data.</span></li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-3"><svg class="mt-1 h-4 w-4 flex-shrink-0 text-brand-accent" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"/></svg><span><strong>Erasure</strong> — request deletion of your data.</span></li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-3"><svg class="mt-1 h-4 w-4 flex-shrink-0 text-brand-accent" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"/></svg><span><strong>Object</strong> — ask us to stop processing your correspondence at any time by contacting us.</span></li>
          </ul>
          <p class="mt-2">To exercise any of these rights, email us at <a href="https://github.com/mabel-co" class="text-brand-accent hover:underline">our GitHub organisation</a>.</p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-ink">Data Processors<span class="heading-underline" aria-hidden="true"></span></h2>
          <p class="mt-2">We use no third-party mailing-list or marketing platform. The site is hosted on GitHub Pages, and GitHub may process standard request metadata to serve it; Google Fonts serves the webfonts referenced by the pages.</p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-ink">Contact<span class="heading-underline" aria-hidden="true"></span></h2>
          <p class="mt-2">If you have questions about this policy or how we handle your data, contact us via <a href="https://github.com/mabel-co" class="text-brand-accent hover:underline">our GitHub organisation</a>. There is no contact form and no email newsletter.</p>
        </section>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>

  <!-- Footer (R2: inherits DEFAULT_SITEMAP, rich) -->
  <SiteFooter />

</BaseLayout>
